emonstrating creative problem-solving skills. Effective communication and collaboration enabled successful product design\n[1]Job Title: PEY VR Technical Assistant\n[1]Company: Medica Providencia Clinic\n[1]Location: Tuxtla Gtz, CS, Mexico\n[1]Duration: 2022/12 - 2023/03\n[1]Description: Collaborated with healthcare professionals, improving patient satisfaction through systematic diagnostics and repairs on Oculus Quest VR equipment\n[1]Job Title: Script Programmer and Video Project Editor\n[1]Company: Ontario Institute for Studies in Education\n[1]Location: Toronto, ON, Canada\n[1]Duration: 2022/03 - 2022/05\n[1]Description: Developed Python ML algorithms, collaborated with stakeholders, and delivered project results within 3 months. Utilized Python programming language, Excel, and effective communication skills\n[0]Projects:\n[1]Project Title: Horizontal Federated Learning Research\n[1]URL: github.com/alexjsenn/FedScale\n[1]Type: Research | Capstone Project\n[1]Duration: 2021/09 - 2022/06\n[1]Description: Developed algorithm that doubled network efficiency with comparable model performance in Federated Machine Learning, utilizing C++/Python. Co-authored technical papers and presentations on novel aggregation algorithms\n[1]Project Title: MAPPA C++ Geographical Information System\n[1]URL: https://github.com/Marneus981/MAPPA\n[1]Type: University Project\n[1]Duration: 2019/09 - 2020/06\n[1]Description: Built a GIS system using OpenStreetMap data and C++ EZGL library, improving algorithm efficiency by 200% and reducing memory usage by 50%. Co-developed UI/UX tailored to stakeholder needs\n[0]Skills:\n[1]Programming Languages: Python, Keras, Pytorch\n[1]Technical Skills: Full-Stack Development, 3D modelling, Algorithm Optimization, Version Control\n[1]Soft Skills: Communication, Collaboration, Good Written and Communication Skills, Adaptability", 'job_description': 'Here is the summarized job description:\n\n**Company Name:** Sentry\n**Job Title:** Software Engineer, New Grad\n\n**Key Responsibilities:**\n\n* Develop and extend the Sentry product in Python or JavaScript (or both)\n* Participate in the full software development lifecycle (design, development, testing, and operating in production)\n* Collaborate with a team to communicate effectively with engineers, product managers, and other stakeholders\n* Act on feedback, coaching, and mentorship from manager and teammates\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n* B.S. or higher in Computer Science (or similar degree program)\n* At least 1 previous internship or equivalent practical experience\n* Implementation skills in one or more general-purpose programming languages (e.g., Python, JavaScript, Java)\n* Good knowledge of algorithms, data structures, and object-oriented design principles\n* Experience working with version control and unit testing\n\n**Needed Skills:**\n\n* Technical:\n\t+ Programming languages: Python, JavaScript, Java\n\t+ Algorithms, data structures, and object-oriented design principles\n\t+ Version control and unit testing\n* Soft:\n\t+ Effective communication skills\n\t+ Ability to take feedback and act on it\n\t+ Collaborative mindset', 'standard_calls': ['make_cover_letter_text'], 'non_standard_calls': []}
